WEBVTT

NOTE Title: Store operations weekly review; Date: 2026-11-26

NOTE Synthetic. Written after the extraction rules were finished and never used to tune them.

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Nadia Rossi: Right, let's start. Three things today: the self-checkout trial, the holiday rota and the stock-count app.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:19.000
Owen Hart: The self-checkout trial in the two pilot stores went fine overall. Shrinkage is up a little though, and I'm worried it gets worse over the holidays.

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Nadia Rossi: OK. Owen, can you pull the shrinkage numbers by store for the last six weeks?

4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Owen Hart: Yep, I'll get those to you by Monday.

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Bea Lindqvist: Should we pause the trial over Christmas? I'd rather not have staff stuck fixing machines on the busiest days.

6
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Nadia Rossi: We've decided to keep the trial running, but with one extra staff member on the self-checkout area at peak times.

7
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Bea Lindqvist: Then the holiday rota needs updating. I'll redo the rota for both pilot stores this week.

8
00:00:52.500 --> 00:01:01.000
Kofi Asante: On the stock-count app, the scanner update is still not certified by the supplier. That might delay the January rollout.

9
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:07.000
Nadia Rossi: Do we know when the certification will be done?

10
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.000
Kofi Asante: No idea, honestly. They keep moving the date.

11
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:18.000
Nadia Rossi: Kofi, please get a firm date from the supplier, in writing, by the 4th of December.

12
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.000
Kofi Asante: Sure.

13
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:28.000
Bea Lindqvist: Someone should also let the store managers know the app might be late, so they plan a paper count as backup.

14
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.000
Owen Hart: I can do that.

15
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:38.000
Nadia Rossi: Good. And the decision on whether stores do the count overnight or before opening is still TBD.

16
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:44.000
Kofi Asante: Last thing. The supplier asked for a store contact, so I gave them Ms Dana Holt's mobile, 07700 900123.

17
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:50.000
Nadia Rossi: Fine, but please send contacts through the supplier portal next time, not by phone. Thanks all.
